WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:03.840
<i>All I ever wanted
was to bring my mother back</i>

00:04.510 --> 00:06.970
<i>and have my family
together again.</i>

00:07.220 --> 00:10.550
<i>But the Ultimate Prize was never
about granting a wish.</i>

00:11.430 --> 00:13.930
<i>As Jordan and I discovered,
the true purpose</i>

00:14.100 --> 00:17.140
<i>of the Grand Race of Oban
is to choose the new Avatar.</i>

00:18.940 --> 00:21.400
<i>Suddenly, I had
no more reason to race.</i>

00:21.940 --> 00:23.020
<i>I quit.</i>

00:24.440 --> 00:26.030
<i>Only to join again.</i>

00:26.740 --> 00:28.950
<i>Kross must be stopped,
or else the Galaxy</i>

00:29.110 --> 00:30.910
<i>will fall to the Crogs.</i>

01:51.780 --> 01:52.780
Whoa, Molly!

01:52.900 --> 01:54.200
Watch out!

01:55.120 --> 01:56.240
|'ITI trying!

02:16.260 --> 02:17.260
Charming.

02:17.760 --> 02:20.560
I'm glad they saved
the best part for last.

02:28.900 --> 02:30.610
Stan, Koji.

02:30.780 --> 02:32.240
You see the first gate?

02:33.200 --> 02:34.660
I've got nothing.

02:37.620 --> 02:39.910
Neither do I. I'm picking up
too much interference

02:40.080 --> 02:40.990
on the main scanners.

02:42.080 --> 02:43.460
Oh, great.

02:45.500 --> 02:47.460
Koji, do you read?

02:54.170 --> 02:55.340
Where are those gates?

02:56.300 --> 02:58.640
If that little Satis
has tricked us again,

02:58.930 --> 03:00.350
I'll tear out his heart!

03:13.360 --> 03:14.650
No regrets?

03:14.820 --> 03:16.070
No regrets.

03:16.240 --> 03:17.570
Whatever happens,

03:18.070 --> 03:19.830
I'm glad it was with you.

03:29.460 --> 03:30.290
Hit it!

03:40.050 --> 03:40.930
What was that?

03:41.930 --> 03:44.060
This is the last race, Jordan.

03:44.390 --> 03:46.350
And it's becoming a battle.

03:58.320 --> 04:01.870
I'm faster, I'm smarter,
and I'm still under warranty.

04:02.830 --> 04:05.080
Living creatures are passé.

04:05.700 --> 04:07.790
The Avatar must be perfect.

04:07.960 --> 04:09.170
Like me!

04:22.800 --> 04:25.600
Stop, Ondai.
I am not your enemy.

04:26.390 --> 04:27.560
That may well be.

04:27.730 --> 04:29.810
But you're standing in my way
just the same!

05:10.140 --> 05:13.100
My revenge will be sweet.

05:37.630 --> 05:39.300
They'll never know
what hit them.

05:50.810 --> 05:51.560
Molly!

06:08.490 --> 06:10.540
Yay! Ya-ha!

06:18.380 --> 06:20.710
Stay at your posts!
We can still...

06:26.220 --> 06:29.140
A captain
never abandons his ship.

06:33.100 --> 06:35.560
What in the world
happened to us?

06:37.480 --> 06:39.110
Jordan, are you OK?

06:40.980 --> 06:42.030
Maybe.

06:42.150 --> 06:43.780
I hurt all over.

07:02.510 --> 07:04.130
I want to live.

07:04.670 --> 07:06.260
Live, live!

07:06.430 --> 07:07.800
Live, live!

07:11.430 --> 07:15.730
The time of the final encounter
approaches.

07:15.890 --> 07:18.190
It has been worth the wait.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.000
Help me, 6!

07:39.170 --> 07:41.670
Alone, I can only
neutralize his powers.

07:46.380 --> 07:48.390
You must help me destroy him!

07:51.930 --> 07:55.270
(A)! Don't leave!
Come back!

08:28.300 --> 08:29.050
Aikka.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.560
Jordan, no!

08:40.850 --> 08:42.730
Aikka was forced
to attack us before.

08:42.900 --> 08:44.190
You know that!

08:44.520 --> 08:47.530
He convinced me to race
to stop the Crogs!

08:50.450 --> 08:53.530
Wake up, Molly.
That guy works for the Crogs.

08:59.160 --> 09:00.750
Molly. Jordan.

09:00.920 --> 09:03.210
Let us forget our past quarrels.

09:08.170 --> 09:09.880
The time has come

09:10.050 --> 09:12.590
for Nourasians and humans
to join forces.

09:14.430 --> 09:15.430
We accept.

09:18.060 --> 09:19.270
Molly...

09:19.430 --> 09:21.560
At least play hard to get.

09:23.310 --> 09:24.110
Thank you.

09:24.310 --> 09:27.530
Together, I have no doubt
we can defeat Kross.

09:28.900 --> 09:32.280
You will make
a wonderful Avatar, Molly.

09:32.450 --> 09:33.360
What do you mean?

09:33.700 --> 09:37.910
I... I was thinking
the same thing about you.

10:00.100 --> 10:01.180
It's the last gate.

10:01.810 --> 10:03.690
Let's beat the Crogs together.

10:04.190 --> 10:06.520
We'll flip a coin
for the Avatar.

10:38.430 --> 10:40.970
<i>Unsaka'|', nourama kobara!</i>

10:45.440 --> 10:46.860
You shall not!

10:56.870 --> 10:58.700
Yeah! <i>Uh...</i> not bad, Prince.

11:08.380 --> 11:10.920
You have disobeyed me
for the last time.

11:28.230 --> 11:28.940
Aikka!

11:30.360 --> 11:32.070
<i>Unsakafshallanar!</i>

11:34.360 --> 11:35.450
<i>Molly...</i>

11:35.820 --> 11:37.700
<i>Do not worry about me.</i>

11:41.410 --> 11:43.910
<i>Stop Kross. Now.</i>

11:53.590 --> 11:54.880
You monster!

11:55.050 --> 11:56.800
I'll never let you be Avatar!

11:57.340 --> 11:58.800
Never!

12:03.010 --> 12:04.350
He's getting away.

12:05.100 --> 12:07.230
The booster drives are
our only chance.

12:07.730 --> 12:09.100
Are you with me?

12:09.600 --> 12:10.730
Go for it.

12:13.780 --> 12:14.530
Hang on.

12:25.250 --> 12:27.580
Sir, I have something. There.

12:31.880 --> 12:32.540
Eva!

12:36.170 --> 12:37.010
Grandpa.

12:37.420 --> 12:39.430
I need your luck
one more time.

13:13.210 --> 13:15.670
You are nothing
but an insect to me, human!

13:16.130 --> 13:19.090
You have no place
in the Galaxy.

13:20.300 --> 13:22.090
<i>There goes nothing.</i>

13:43.530 --> 13:44.700
By Kramm!

14:01.340 --> 14:02.840
Yeah! Molly!

14:05.390 --> 14:06.140
Way to go!

14:18.520 --> 14:19.860
<i>Mother...</i>

14:23.070 --> 14:23.700
...WOI1.

14:23.820 --> 14:26.870
Molly, we won!
I can't believe it!

14:31.040 --> 14:31.950
Wait!

14:32.120 --> 14:33.750
I've gotta find Aikka.

14:33.920 --> 14:36.250
You've gotta let me go.
He needs me.

14:36.580 --> 14:37.840
Let me go!

14:53.480 --> 14:54.520
No, don't.

14:55.270 --> 14:56.440
I must...

14:57.060 --> 14:58.190
Molly, what's going on?

15:01.940 --> 15:03.900
Molly!

15:27.970 --> 15:30.510
Congratulations, Molly.

15:34.100 --> 15:37.020
I'm sorry I had
to pluck you away like that.

15:37.190 --> 15:39.980
But the enthronement ceremony
waits for no one.

15:40.520 --> 15:41.900
The what?

15:47.860 --> 15:49.620
Don't be afraid.

15:50.660 --> 15:54.250
The enormity of the task
scared me, too, at first.

15:54.500 --> 15:56.290
But you'll make
a perfect Avatar.

16:00.880 --> 16:02.170
I'll keep that in mind.

16:02.340 --> 16:04.460
But your little ceremony
will have to wait.

16:04.760 --> 16:07.260
But... but that's impossible!

16:10.510 --> 16:11.800
Please, Molly!

16:12.350 --> 16:13.680
You don't understand.

16:14.020 --> 16:15.520
Time is running out!

16:16.850 --> 16:20.020
Oban will die
without an Avatar.

16:22.690 --> 16:24.530
I'll be back soon. Promise.

16:24.780 --> 16:26.940
Anyway,
the man for the job is Aikka.

16:27.150 --> 16:27.860
Stop!

16:35.660 --> 16:36.950
Too late.

16:37.210 --> 16:39.750
All my magic is gone.

16:41.380 --> 16:44.340
Oban is totally unprotected.

17:09.950 --> 17:12.160
Free.

17:12.530 --> 17:14.830
At last.

17:15.540 --> 17:18.370
After an eternity...

17:18.960 --> 17:22.920
My time has come!

17:28.460 --> 17:30.590
-Eva?
-Later, Dad.

17:30.760 --> 17:32.090
Eva! Wait!

17:32.640 --> 17:33.970
What happened?

18:08.130 --> 18:09.840
What in the name of...

18:16.800 --> 18:17.470
What?

18:18.260 --> 18:19.680
What is this?

18:31.400 --> 18:32.610
Canaletto.

18:33.490 --> 18:36.820
I have long awaited
this moment, Satis.

18:37.280 --> 18:40.830
But now 10,000 years
seems a mere blink.

18:41.580 --> 18:43.410
You have no right to be here.

18:43.540 --> 18:45.250
Keep away from the throne room!

18:46.920 --> 18:48.460
Did you have the right

18:48.630 --> 18:51.090
to lock me in that cage
for millennia?

18:51.760 --> 18:54.880
Me, the Lord of Purity,

18:55.050 --> 18:58.720
a greater Avatar
than you ever were.

18:59.350 --> 19:01.720
You refused
to give up your seat.

19:01.970 --> 19:05.690
The Avatar cannot use
his powers for his own gain!

19:10.900 --> 19:13.860
I do as I please.

19:14.320 --> 19:17.740
You still have
no grasp of it, do you?

19:17.910 --> 19:21.450
Despite my pure guidance.

19:22.240 --> 19:24.870
<i>Despite my just punishments.</i>

19:25.620 --> 19:28.630
<i>Imperfection and impurity</i>

19:28.790 --> 19:32.130
<i>still infects this galaxy.</i>

19:34.720 --> 19:38.050
My crusade was left incomplete,

19:38.390 --> 19:41.890
and now I will complete it.

19:42.060 --> 19:45.690
You were a danger before,
but now...

19:47.770 --> 19:51.570
Enough.
Your time is over.

19:52.730 --> 19:57.240
Confining me as you did
had one positive effect.

19:57.410 --> 19:59.780
It allowed me to think,

19:59.950 --> 20:02.490
and to think again...

20:03.950 --> 20:07.370
Oban, grant me your powers
one last time.

20:07.540 --> 20:10.790
This galaxy can never be saved.

20:11.090 --> 20:13.840
The work of the Creators was flawed.

20:15.300 --> 20:19.090
The only solution
is to destroy the old

20:19.260 --> 20:20.930
and start anew.

20:21.100 --> 20:23.140
Reborn.

20:24.100 --> 20:28.940
For this, I will take
my rightful place as Avatar again.

20:29.770 --> 20:31.020
No! Never!

20:38.900 --> 20:39.990
Clever.

20:40.570 --> 20:42.870
But unwise.

20:56.670 --> 20:58.840
Climb in the Whizzing Arrow!
All of you!

21:05.560 --> 21:06.390
Molly!

21:06.720 --> 21:07.640
Take off, now!

21:14.360 --> 21:15.570
What have I done?
